# Traveling Botanist: "Whenever this creature becomes tapped" (attacking taps it), it looks at the top card; a land (Forest) may be revealed and put into the hand. Taken, it is not offered to the graveyard as well.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Traveling Botanist
Island x5
Swamp
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Traveling Botanist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Traveling Botanist > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Looked = Forest
Bot1.Accept
! Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Revealed = Forest

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Colors.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 1
